      {
        "id": 119813,
        "name": "Donner",
        "username": "Donner",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/donner/{size}/1903_2.png",
        "created_at": "2014-10-30T21:59:19.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Yours is more of a splitting into source damage and target damage. &nbsp;Source damage stuff doesn't change. &nbsp;Target damage stuff does. &nbsp;So only recalculate the part that does. &nbsp;And yes, I include Nemesis bonus as target damage. &nbsp;Its change is dependent upon the target. &nbsp;Twist the Ether is source damage, since its effect is independent of the target.</p>",
        "post_number": 26,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T03:53:07.310Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
        "quote_count": 0,
